- Tempo & Pulse: 54–76 BPM. A heavy, dragging 12/8 blues shuffle fused with the deliberate, ponderous tread of a cinematic funeral march, propelled by foot-stomped curb stones and clacking mechanical relay switches.
- Harmonic Palette: Minor pentatonic and Dorian blues scales forcefully stretched over sweeping neo-romantic orchestral progressions (I–bVI–bVII–IV); gut-wrenching blue-note microtonal bends harmonized in fifths by soaring brass choirs.
